### Get all words
GET https://0xok06khai.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/dev/daily-dragon/vocabulary
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Get n random words
GET https://0xok06khai.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/daily-dragon/vocabulary?count=5
Authorization: Bearer <token>

###
OPTIONS http://0xok06khai.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/daily-dragon/vocabulary

### Add a new word
POST https://0xok06khai.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/daily-dragon/vocabulary
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
    "word": "你好"
}

### Delete a word
DELETE https://0xok06khai.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/daily-dragon/vocabulary/%E4%BD%A0%E5%A5%BD
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Get due words for review (spaced repetition)
GET https://0xok06khai.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/daily-dragon/vocabulary/due
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Submit batch reviews with quality ratings (spaced repetition)
# Quality ratings: 0 (blackout) to 5 (perfect recall)
POST https://0xok06khai.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/daily-dragon/vocabulary/reviews
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviews": [
    {"word": "你好", "quality": 5},
    {"word": "学习", "quality": 4},
    {"word": "中文", "quality": 3}
  ]
}
